{"message":"Understood. I can’t schedule or automatically execute a future account opening, so please contact us again on or after 11/28/2025 and request the Gold Account. I’ll then verify that your Purple Account has remained open and that you meet the savings-account requirements before opening it.

You may fund the new Gold Account yourself after it is opened. If you do not fund it immediately, the standard funding window is 30 days from opening; otherwise, the account may be closed.

I have not submitted the Silver Rewards Card application. Since you’ve submitted it separately, watch for the decision email within the stated 5–7 business days. If approved and linked to the Gold Account, the projected rate remains 5.8% APY: 5.5% base + 0.1% Purple pairing boost + 0.2% Silver Rewards Card bonus."}
